 "title": "16 A triacs, standard, logic level and Snubberless, 600 V and 800 V: BTA16, BTB16, T1610, T1635, T1650",
 "source": {
  "revision": "DS2114 Rev 11, May 2018",
  "pages": 18
 },
 "summary": "A family of 16 A RMS triacs for AC mains switching, rated 600 V or 800 V off-state. Standard B and C types trigger in four quadrants; Snubberless W types and the T16 D²PAK parts trigger in three quadrants and have high commutation capability for inductive loads. BTB16 sits in TO-220AB with a live tab, BTA16 in an insulated TO-220AB (2500 VRMS), and T1610/T1635/T1650 in D²PAK. BTB16-800CWRG is the 800 V, 35 mA Snubberless TO-220AB part in a tube.",
 "key_figures": [
